Z||000011||FieroGT||11-05-1999||09:47 PM||||Cliff:<BR>Will this voting process be via e-mail and off the board? That would probably be the easiest way. I can't see loading a thread with over 600 posts in it!<P>Everyone:<BR>I am truly amazed at the level of maturity on this board. Age has nothing to do with it, either. It seems we have a group of good people wo are willing to accept the fact that others will have dissenting opionions, and respect that fact. And I've also seen that if someone is wrong about something, they are quite prompt with an apology. That's class, as far as I'm concerned. Too bad we all don't live within a couple hours of each other. But wait, there's this pesky thing I have that keeps me very busy....what do you call it......that's right! A job! At least it keeps the finances going to be able to undertake the financial burden of modifying/repairing our plastic sleds.<P>I think that the collective board intellect has what it takes to support a successful "off-topic" section of the forum. As long as we keep it classy and police ourselves, it can prove to ba a great success. I'm for it!<P>(sounds of putting soapbox & thesaurus away)||||reg||10
